    "path": "/merge_program_documentation",
    "method": "POST",
    "category": "documentation",
    "description": "Bulk merge: copy ALL RE documentation from one program to another at matching addresses, in a single server-side transaction. Categories: function names + signatures + plate comments + locals + calling convention + no-return + tags; standalone data types; data definitions (typed globals); plate comments at any address; comments at all 4 types (EOL/PRE/POST/REPEATABLE) on instructions AND data; labels & globals (with namespace preservation); external locations (ordinal renames); bookmarks; equates. Designed for the orphan-rescue workflow: source is typically '<name>_recovered', target is the original '<name>.dll'. Idempotent — re-running on an already-merged target only fills gaps. Set dry_run=true to count without writing.（上游 MCP headless 服务器）",
